WEBVTT

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:15.750
Full energy is troubled because there's no place to go

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:22.030
A slight shake destroys boredom

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:28.170
I Ride, On the White Line  OH, OH, OH

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:34.240
Sit Down  At the place I trust  OH, OH, OH

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:37.540
We can go even if we're lost

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:43.650
Everyone receives freedom and passion

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:49.850
We were born to shine, and our journey continues

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:56.060
Your soul is the key that supports our uncertain days

00:00:56.350 --> 00:01:02.000
The best growth creates an unstoppable WILD DRIVE

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:08.270
We still quietly knock on the door

00:01:17.990 --> 00:01:24.000
Duel on Ice  Anzu in Danger

00:01:33.780 --> 00:01:35.200
Almost there.

00:01:35.560 --> 00:01:37.320
Come on, Anzu.

00:01:43.340 --> 00:01:44.980
How long is this place?

00:01:44.980 --> 00:01:47.920
Partner, we can't waste time.

00:01:48.280 --> 00:01:52.020
Their goal is to steal our bodies.

00:01:52.340 --> 00:01:54.200
We must find our friends soon.

00:01:54.200 --> 00:01:56.420
They may already be dueling!

00:01:56.420 --> 00:01:57.310
Let's hurry.

00:01:57.310 --> 00:01:57.900
Yeah.

00:02:02.700 --> 00:02:04.270
Yugi Muto.

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:08.270
Yugi defeated Pegasus, who beat Seto Kaiba.

00:02:08.660 --> 00:02:10.760
I can't let you intefere.

00:02:10.760 --> 00:02:14.550
I'll make a special labyrinth just for you.

00:02:17.610 --> 00:02:19.000
What?

00:02:25.050 --> 00:02:26.380
Master Noa.

00:02:26.680 --> 00:02:27.880
Otaki?

00:02:27.880 --> 00:02:28.790
Yes.

00:02:29.080 --> 00:02:32.060
Can you let me go next?

00:02:32.480 --> 00:02:35.030
Sure.  Who will you pick as your opponent?

00:02:39.280 --> 00:02:41.770
I've already picked my target.

00:02:42.670 --> 00:02:43.880
Do what you like.

00:02:53.160 --> 00:02:55.160
I'm so tired.

00:03:02.270 --> 00:03:03.860
Hey Yugi.

00:03:04.120 --> 00:03:07.600
Do you have the Dark Magician Girl card?

00:03:07.910 --> 00:03:10.320
I heard it's a very rare card.

00:03:10.320 --> 00:03:12.470
Huh?  Yeah, I have it.

00:03:13.240 --> 00:03:13.970
See.

00:03:15.120 --> 00:03:16.210
This is it?

00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:18.940
Why are you interested in this card?

00:03:18.940 --> 00:03:20.110
Oh, I know!

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:24.450
It's the musical “The Black Magician Girl in the Moonlight".

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:30.450
Yes.  I can't forget the Broadway musical I saw during middle school.

00:03:38.360 --> 00:03:42.230
When I study dancing abroad, I want to play that role someday.

00:03:53.480 --> 00:03:54.680
No way!

00:04:01.320 --> 00:04:02.800
Yugi!

00:04:03.570 --> 00:04:04.940
Yugi...

00:04:10.830 --> 00:04:11.830
A penguin?

00:04:11.830 --> 00:04:13.870
Hey!  I know you!

00:04:18.080 --> 00:04:19.720
Back then...

00:04:23.630 --> 00:04:24.670
What?

00:04:28.490 --> 00:04:30.360
You want me to follow you?

00:04:49.310 --> 00:04:51.050
Get on board?

00:04:56.250 --> 00:04:57.610
Ouch.

00:05:06.590 --> 00:05:09.580
Where are we going?

00:05:11.300 --> 00:05:12.420
Wait!

00:05:18.440 --> 00:05:19.550
What?

00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:30.110
So many penguins.

00:05:38.020 --> 00:05:39.650
A country of penguins?

00:06:03.020 --> 00:06:05.810
Welcome Anzu Mazaki, 16 years old.

00:06:05.810 --> 00:06:08.410
Who is it?  Show yourself!

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:10.060
Calm down.

00:06:10.060 --> 00:06:12.920
The audition has already begun.

00:06:13.230 --> 00:06:14.300
Audition?

00:06:14.730 --> 00:06:20.960
Don't you want to act in the musical “The Black Magician Girl in the Moonlight”?

00:06:21.930 --> 00:06:27.800
Kaiba Corporation sponsors many Broadway musicals.

00:06:28.700 --> 00:06:33.300
It won't be hard to let you play the leading role.

00:06:33.650 --> 00:06:36.170
I'll play the leading role on Broadway?

00:06:36.800 --> 00:06:38.480
Isn't that great?

00:06:38.480 --> 00:06:40.820
It's the musical you love.

00:06:43.680 --> 00:06:45.400
Are you...

00:06:45.400 --> 00:06:51.460
Yes.  I'm Kaiba Corporation's former executive director of human resources.

00:06:51.460 --> 00:06:54.260
Shuzo Otaki, 55 years old.

00:06:56.950 --> 00:06:59.660
Let's begin the audition interview.

00:07:00.080 --> 00:07:01.400
What interview?!

00:07:01.670 --> 00:07:03.960
Anzu Mazaki, 16 years old.

00:07:03.960 --> 00:07:07.400
Due to your father's job, you've traveled around the world.

00:07:07.400 --> 00:07:12.280
You saw "The Black Magician Girl in the Moonlight" in New York and loved it.

00:07:12.520 --> 00:07:14.040
How do you know that?

00:07:14.970 --> 00:07:18.380
Never underestimate the information network of a big company.

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:21.220
Excellent grades, excels at sports.

00:07:21.220 --> 00:07:27.390
But you never joined a team so you could secretly work part-time at a hamburger shop.

00:07:27.390 --> 00:07:30.570
In order to save money to study dance abroad.

00:07:30.570 --> 00:07:36.460
How admirable.  But is that enough to make your dreams come true?

00:07:36.460 --> 00:07:39.270
I won't know unless I try!

00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:44.640
That's not true.  I know because this personal history tells your tale.

00:07:44.860 --> 00:07:47.640
You're fine sitting on the dirty ground.

00:07:47.640 --> 00:07:52.150
You don't realize that you're rude, always talking about yourself.

00:07:52.410 --> 00:07:55.150
You're a fool, like all young people.

00:07:55.150 --> 00:07:57.750
You have no potential.

00:07:57.750 --> 00:08:00.160
A sad future awaits you.

00:08:00.380 --> 00:08:02.890
Hey!  You don't get to decide!

00:08:03.170 --> 00:08:06.930
Since birth, you've littered 12 times.

00:08:07.150 --> 00:08:09.270
You left the water running 35 times.

00:08:09.500 --> 00:08:12.110
You forgot to turn off the lights 62 times.

00:08:12.110 --> 00:08:12.670
No way!

00:08:12.970 --> 00:08:17.550
What if all five billion people on Earth copied you?

00:08:17.550 --> 00:08:21.410
Wasting energy is one of the causes of global warming.

00:08:21.410 --> 00:08:24.850
It makes it harder for penguins to live.

00:08:24.850 --> 00:08:25.910
Penguins?

00:08:26.570 --> 00:08:32.890
If you can't understand how penguins feel, you won't be able to touch people emotionally.

00:08:35.100 --> 00:08:36.970
What are you talking about?

00:08:36.970 --> 00:08:38.740
But don't worry.

00:08:38.740 --> 00:08:46.400
I'll take your body and be reborn as an Earth-loving high school girl.

00:08:46.400 --> 00:08:50.220
I won't accept a challenge from a disgusting man like you!

00:08:51.140 --> 00:08:52.650
I won't let you escape!

00:08:56.520 --> 00:08:58.700
Anzu Mazaki, 16 years old.

00:08:58.700 --> 00:09:01.720
You failed the interview.

00:09:04.700 --> 00:09:05.520
What?

00:09:09.440 --> 00:09:10.940
What's going on?

00:09:15.530 --> 00:09:18.500
The field I selected is a frozen ocean!

00:09:20.310 --> 00:09:25.740
Anzu Mazaki, 16 years old, select your cards and build a deck.

00:09:25.740 --> 00:09:32.250
The only way to escape from here is to defeat me in a duel.

00:09:32.540 --> 00:09:35.460
But I don't know which cards to choose.

00:09:37.140 --> 00:09:38.540
Sage's Stone?

00:09:38.820 --> 00:09:40.490
It may come in handy.

00:09:42.240 --> 00:09:45.230
I'll choose cards that seem useful.

00:09:45.230 --> 00:09:49.330
When you're done, pick a Deck Master from your deck.

00:09:52.680 --> 00:09:55.520
This is my Deck Master!

00:09:58.080 --> 00:09:59.510
Dark Magician Girl!

00:10:00.540 --> 00:10:02.560
Two beautiful young girls.

00:10:02.560 --> 00:10:05.080
So I'll double the torment.

00:10:05.280 --> 00:10:09.910
As you can see, my Deck Master is Nightmare Penguin.

00:10:09.910 --> 00:10:14.160
Let's begin this icy duel that will freeze you!

00:10:14.400 --> 00:10:17.490
I'll never lose to you!

00:10:21.400 --> 00:10:22.480
Duel!

00:10:24.140 --> 00:10:25.920
What's this place?

00:10:28.580 --> 00:10:29.670
Don't touch it!

00:10:30.200 --> 00:10:32.840
I have a bad feeling about that door.

00:10:40.140 --> 00:10:42.170
There's a monster inside the door!

00:10:42.170 --> 00:10:43.180
Partner.

00:10:43.480 --> 00:10:47.560
A new game has begun.

00:10:47.900 --> 00:10:49.120
My turn!

00:10:49.370 --> 00:10:50.400
I draw!

00:10:51.200 --> 00:10:52.930
I drew a good card.

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:55.610
I set one card.

00:10:55.900 --> 00:10:59.100
And I summon Ancient Elf!

00:10:59.510 --> 00:11:01.200
I end my turn.

00:11:02.340 --> 00:11:05.140
My turn.  I draw.

00:11:05.340 --> 00:11:08.730
I summon Giant Red Seasnake.

00:11:12.650 --> 00:11:15.150
Giant Red Seasnake gained attack points?

00:11:15.360 --> 00:11:22.490
Yes.  My Deck Master's ability powers up my Water Attribute monsters.

00:11:22.490 --> 00:11:26.730
Now my monster has much more attack points than yours!

00:11:27.510 --> 00:11:29.510
But I have Mirror Force.

00:11:29.960 --> 00:11:32.430
Hurry up and attack!

00:11:32.640 --> 00:11:34.430
Don't be impatient.

00:11:34.430 --> 00:11:37.480
There's one good thing about being old.

00:11:37.480 --> 00:11:39.400
Know what it is?

00:11:39.400 --> 00:11:40.040
What?

00:11:40.380 --> 00:11:43.650
You learn to be more careful.

00:11:43.860 --> 00:11:47.900
The card by your feet must be a trap.

00:11:48.530 --> 00:11:51.750
How naughty of you to try to trap me.

00:11:51.960 --> 00:11:54.570
But your little trick won't work.

00:11:54.570 --> 00:11:58.860
I activate the spell card Cold Wave.

00:12:01.110 --> 00:12:07.100
Cold Wave is a spell card that disables all set cards for one turn.

00:12:07.900 --> 00:12:11.340
Nothing can stop my attack now.

00:12:11.910 --> 00:12:13.880
Go, Giant Red Seasnake!

00:12:17.050 --> 00:12:18.710
Ancient Elf!

00:12:21.510 --> 00:12:29.620
I forgot to mention that when you lose life points in this duel, your body freezes.

00:12:30.530 --> 00:12:33.540
You must feel so cold.

00:12:33.540 --> 00:12:37.210
I'll freeze your whole body soon.

00:12:54.650 --> 00:12:56.170
So cold...

00:12:57.500 --> 00:12:58.670
Yugi...

00:12:59.170 --> 00:12:59.990
Anzu!

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:02.060
Where are you, Anzu?

00:13:02.320 --> 00:13:03.790
I'm cold.

00:13:04.000 --> 00:13:04.960
Anzu!

00:13:05.200 --> 00:13:09.360
Is she in the middle of a duel?

00:13:09.360 --> 00:13:12.230
We were forced to hear her peril.

00:13:12.230 --> 00:13:13.460
How cruel.

00:13:13.460 --> 00:13:15.780
We have to get to Anzu quickly!

00:13:19.900 --> 00:13:21.260
Don't lose your cool.

00:13:21.260 --> 00:13:23.240
Don't be reckless.

00:13:23.240 --> 00:13:24.540
But Anzu is...

00:13:24.760 --> 00:13:26.160
Look above the door.

00:13:29.120 --> 00:13:33.290
I see.  It's the Level of the monster inside the door.

00:13:33.500 --> 00:13:34.240
Yes.

00:13:34.240 --> 00:13:37.730
Noa created this game for us.

00:13:38.600 --> 00:13:42.560
In that case, we know how to escape.

00:13:43.340 --> 00:13:46.830
A Level 1 monster can't defeat this card!

00:13:48.240 --> 00:13:50.870
Go, Winged Dragon, Guardian of the Fortress #1!

00:13:59.310 --> 00:14:00.180
All right!

00:14:00.400 --> 00:14:01.820
Look, partner.

00:14:02.820 --> 00:14:05.020
There's more ahead.

00:14:05.330 --> 00:14:06.290
Let's go.

00:14:07.640 --> 00:14:09.360
It's your turn.

00:14:09.680 --> 00:14:10.790
I know.

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:13.460
My turn.  I draw.

00:14:15.370 --> 00:14:17.970
I-  set a monster in defense position.

00:14:18.200 --> 00:14:20.780
Oh my.  You hands are numb.

00:14:20.780 --> 00:14:24.680
It's because you're wearing risqué clothing.

00:14:26.870 --> 00:14:29.240
I-I end my turn.

00:14:29.460 --> 00:14:30.930
Poor thing.

00:14:30.930 --> 00:14:34.480
Shall I give you my favorite trousers?

00:14:34.640 --> 00:14:35.820
My turn.

00:14:36.420 --> 00:14:39.400
What should I do...

00:14:39.400 --> 00:14:40.820
This one?

00:14:40.820 --> 00:14:42.490
Or this one?

00:14:42.720 --> 00:14:44.560
Stop stalling!  That's cheating!

00:14:46.050 --> 00:14:49.340
I'm not afraid of your amateur magician.

00:14:49.340 --> 00:14:54.940
But if you summon Dark Magician, it'll be bad because she'll unleash her true abilities.

00:14:54.940 --> 00:14:56.770
I have to be careful.

00:14:57.040 --> 00:14:58.270
Dark Magician?

00:14:58.600 --> 00:15:02.710
Anzu Mazaki, 16 years old.  What's wrong?

00:15:03.250 --> 00:15:04.710
Nothing.

00:15:04.920 --> 00:15:09.580
Don't tell me that you don't have Dark Magician in your deck?

00:15:11.040 --> 00:15:14.250
Oh my.  It seems I'm correct.

00:15:16.370 --> 00:15:18.280
You're so dumb!

00:15:18.280 --> 00:15:24.860
It's common knowledge that Dark Magician Girl and Dark Magician work as a pair!

00:15:24.860 --> 00:15:31.600
Dark Magician Girl without Dark Magician is like curry without pickled vegetables!

00:15:32.030 --> 00:15:34.400
Be quiet!  It won't matter when I win!

00:15:35.170 --> 00:15:38.530
You're confident even though you're incompetent.

00:15:38.530 --> 00:15:42.660
A perfect representation of today's youth.

00:15:42.820 --> 00:15:45.640
I set two cards.

00:15:45.640 --> 00:15:47.420
I end my turn.

00:15:47.660 --> 00:15:51.930
He didn't attack because he's worried about my set card.

00:15:51.930 --> 00:15:56.700
I know what your empty head is planning.

00:15:56.920 --> 00:15:59.000
You're so annoying!

00:15:59.000 --> 00:16:00.220
My turn!

00:16:00.440 --> 00:16:02.700
The Quick-Play Spell Mystical Space Typhoon!

00:16:02.710 --> 00:16:05.910
It destroys one of your set cards!

00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:10.730
You fell for it.

00:16:10.730 --> 00:16:12.360
I was waiting for this moment.

00:16:12.360 --> 00:16:13.850
I activate my trap card!

00:16:15.280 --> 00:16:17.220
Driving Snow!

00:16:17.430 --> 00:16:22.460
Driving Snow activates when a set card is destroyed.

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:26.300
Your set card is also destroyed.

00:16:27.460 --> 00:16:31.840
How dangerous!  It was Mirror Force.

00:16:31.840 --> 00:16:34.700
Now Giant Red Seasnake has no obstacles.

00:16:34.940 --> 00:16:38.500
No, my turn isn't over yet.

00:16:46.700 --> 00:16:49.080
I'll be your hands.

00:16:50.450 --> 00:16:52.090
Dark Magician Girl.

00:16:53.770 --> 00:16:55.760
I play this card!

00:16:56.260 --> 00:16:57.950
Offerings to the Doomed!

00:17:01.500 --> 00:17:07.080
I can't draw next turn, but your monster is destroyed!

00:17:08.780 --> 00:17:13.010
And I switch my monster from defense to attack position!

00:17:13.370 --> 00:17:14.370
Wake up!

00:17:19.600 --> 00:17:22.080
Fire Sorcerer!

00:17:22.360 --> 00:17:24.950
Please warm us up!

00:17:34.380 --> 00:17:35.440
Thank you!

00:17:35.440 --> 00:17:38.860
I activate Fire Sorcerer's effect!

00:17:39.140 --> 00:17:44.100
By banishing two cards from my hand,  you take 800 points of damage!

00:17:46.720 --> 00:17:48.020
Hot!  Hot!

00:17:50.860 --> 00:17:53.250
My attack isn't over!

00:17:53.250 --> 00:17:55.770
Go, Fire Sorcerer!

00:17:55.770 --> 00:17:57.330
Fire Blast!

00:18:03.530 --> 00:18:04.570
How's that?

00:18:04.570 --> 00:18:06.630
It's your turn to freeze!

00:18:09.930 --> 00:18:11.530
Not bad.

00:18:11.530 --> 00:18:15.700
But this amount of ice doesn't bother me.

00:18:15.920 --> 00:18:18.440
Because I'm a penguin.

00:18:18.680 --> 00:18:21.140
One thing about you interests me.

00:18:21.400 --> 00:18:23.210
That's nice to hear.

00:18:23.470 --> 00:18:26.550
Why are you so fixated on penguins?

00:18:26.760 --> 00:18:28.940
That's what interests you?

00:18:28.940 --> 00:18:33.370
Because penguins saved my life.

00:18:33.370 --> 00:18:34.150
Penguins?

00:18:34.380 --> 00:18:38.000
My parents didn't like each other.

00:18:38.000 --> 00:18:41.960
Since I was young, they fought all the time.

00:18:41.960 --> 00:18:45.200
Right in front of their child.

00:18:45.200 --> 00:18:49.400
My life at home was hopeless.

00:18:49.730 --> 00:18:53.550
That's when I learned about penguins.

00:18:53.550 --> 00:18:59.950
I read that adult penguins work together to warm their eggs.

00:18:59.950 --> 00:19:06.950
I started going to the aquarium everyday to watch the penguins.

00:19:07.600 --> 00:19:12.960
Penguins were the only thing that comforted my hardened heart.

00:19:13.180 --> 00:19:17.720
My dream was to live with penguins someday.

00:19:17.720 --> 00:19:20.070
And my dream came true.

00:19:20.280 --> 00:19:21.020
What?

00:19:21.020 --> 00:19:28.420
I climbed Kaiba Corporation's corporate ladder and asked to build a penguin facility in Kaiba Land.

00:19:28.420 --> 00:19:34.310
I knew that cute penguins would heal the hardened hearts of people today.

00:19:34.520 --> 00:19:35.850
But...

00:19:36.500 --> 00:19:37.680
Penguins?

00:19:38.050 --> 00:19:40.700
If it's black and white, pandas are better.

00:19:40.700 --> 00:19:42.700
Rejected, Otaki.

00:19:43.200 --> 00:19:48.790
Instead of lame games, why won't he teach children about the kindness of penguins?

00:19:49.000 --> 00:19:50.700
That's no reason to be angry!

00:19:51.700 --> 00:19:58.600
I never expected a dumb high school girl to understand how I feel!

00:19:58.820 --> 00:20:02.820
But I can't forgive you for helping Kaiba.

00:20:03.160 --> 00:20:11.000
I'll take your body, return to the real world and build my lifelong dream - Penguin Land!

00:20:11.000 --> 00:20:12.580
My turn!

00:20:13.140 --> 00:20:15.990
Come out, Flying Penguin!

00:20:19.560 --> 00:20:22.720
My Deck Master's ability powers it up!

00:20:23.280 --> 00:20:29.970
I equip it with Penguin Sword to power it up by 800 points!

00:20:30.280 --> 00:20:32.350
2200 attack points?

00:20:32.350 --> 00:20:35.240
Go!  Destroy that nuisance!

00:20:35.410 --> 00:20:37.910
Ice Bolt!

00:20:41.400 --> 00:20:42.680
Fire Sorcerer!

00:20:48.970 --> 00:20:51.050
Anzu Mazaki, 16 years old.

00:20:51.050 --> 00:20:53.930
Your fire of hope is extinguished.

00:20:53.930 --> 00:20:57.580
I'll freeze you for eternity.

00:20:57.820 --> 00:20:58.910
Yugi...

00:21:01.510 --> 00:21:03.530
Damn.  How far does this go?

00:21:03.780 --> 00:21:06.960
Yugi...  Save me, Yugi!

00:21:07.260 --> 00:21:08.710
I hear Anzu again!

00:21:09.180 --> 00:21:11.440
We need to get out of here!

00:21:12.890 --> 00:21:15.050
Partner, look down.

00:21:17.460 --> 00:21:19.540
I threw this coin earlier.

00:21:19.820 --> 00:21:22.100
That means...

00:21:22.720 --> 00:21:25.560
We're back to the same place?

00:21:46.880 --> 00:21:50.600
I can't stop the old Penguin's attacks anymore!

00:21:50.600 --> 00:21:52.600
Wait, Dark Magician Girl!

00:21:52.600 --> 00:21:56.780
If you come out and get destroyed, we lose!

00:21:56.780 --> 00:22:01.300
I'll lose before Yugi can escape Noa's labyrinth!

00:22:01.300 --> 00:22:03.120
I have to bet on this draw!

00:22:03.120 --> 00:22:05.360
Something to make a comeback!

00:22:06.120 --> 00:22:09.040
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Shine!  Sage's Stone

00:22:09.040 --> 00:22:10.560
Duel, standby!

00:22:15.960 --> 00:22:23.860
The sun never sets
It rises forever

00:22:23.860 --> 00:22:32.810
Don't let a dream end as a dream

00:22:33.140 --> 00:22:37.780
The straight rail and harsh route

00:22:37.780 --> 00:22:41.750
Whether to go or not 
all of yourself

00:22:42.180 --> 00:22:49.720
I'm tired of counting on my fingers inside this cage

00:22:49.720 --> 00:22:53.290
Respect! Boys  Show me how you act tough

00:22:53.290 --> 00:22:58.060
Draw a map, even if it's sloppy

00:22:58.060 --> 00:23:08.170
And walk it without stopping

00:23:08.170 --> 00:23:15.780
The sun never sets
If I can be like you

00:23:16.010 --> 00:23:24.750
Create freedom by exceeding common ideas

00:23:24.750 --> 00:23:32.730
I want to trust myself
Sometimes I'll lose my way but

00:23:32.730 --> 00:23:42.570
I hide it in my heart...
Secret Paradise
